BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:2026-09-20_sun_half-marathon@trainingplan.local
DTSTAMP:20260710T063151Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:[Race] Half Marathon · 21km
DESCRIPTION:Session: 2026-09-20_sun_half-marathon\nType: race  ·  Status: 
 planned\n\nTargets:\n  - duration_min: 115\n  - distance_km: 21.1\n  - avg
 _hr_range: [138\, 148]\n  - avg_pace_min_per_km: 5:27\n\nNotes:\n*** RACE 
 *** Half marathon — 21.1 km. Sub-1:55 target (5:27/km).\n\nPacing\n  Km 
 1-3: AT goal pace\, not under it. It must feel easy.\n  Km 4-15: settle at
  5:25-5:30\, HR 138-148. Lock in.\n  Km 16-21: whatever is left. This is w
 here the taper pays out.\n\nFueling\n  Breakfast 2.5-3 h out\, familiar ca
 rbs.\n  1 gel ~15 min before start\, 1 gel around km 10-12.\n  Water at st
 ations — a few sips each\, don't skip.\n\nIf the day goes sideways\n  HR
  > 150 in the first 5 km → ease off 10 s/km immediately.\n  Side stitch 
 → exhale hard on the opposite foot strike\, shorten stride until it clea
 rs.
DTSTART:20260920T070000
DTEND:20260920T085500
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
